  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_2521.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(38 fotos en total) La sala de reunions del Centre d&#39;Ocupaci&oacute; i Cultura ha acollit aquest cap de setmana la presentaci&oacute; de la nova Associaci&oacute; Cultural Multilabors d&#39;Onda, amb Ver&oacute;nica Cons com a mestra de cerim&ograve;nies (17 fotos).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_5458.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Abans de constituir l&#39;Associaci&oacute;, les festes de Nadal 2014-15 ja es va organitzar una activitat decorant els vlotants del Caf&eacute; delBanc i de la Casa de la Vila, al Pla (21 fotos).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2511.jpg\" alt=\"img_2511\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2514.jpg\" alt=\"img_2514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2515.jpg\" alt=\"img_2515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2516.jpg\" alt=\"img_2516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2517.jpg\" alt=\"img_2517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2518.jpg\" alt=\"img_2518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenassocmultilabor/img_2519.jpg\" alt=\"img_2519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91